+
+## Identity
+
+**helioscope** — Umbrella monorepo for the Helioscope platform: a community fork of OpenAI Codex CLI with multi-backend execution, sandboxing, and Phenotype governance integration.
+
+**Location:** `repos/helioscope`
+
+## Responsibilities
+
+- ⚙️ **Primary:** Provide a unified CLI/API for AI coding agent execution (Docker, Kubernetes, Local, Sandbox backends)
+- ⚙️ **Secondary:** Host the codex-rs Rust workspace (core agent crates, harness system) and codex-cli TypeScript workspace (agent UI, TUI, tools)
+- Consumes `phenotype/phenotype-ops` for CI, attestation, and review gates
+- Publishes `helios-cli` binaries and crates to internal registry
+
+## Key Commands
+
+```bash
+# Build (Cargo workspace — harness crates)
+cargo build
+
+# Build (codex-rs sub-workspace)
+cargo build --manifest-path codex-rs/Cargo.toml
+
+# Build (Bazel — full monorepo)
+bazel build //...
+
+# Test
+cargo test --workspace
+
+# Lint
+cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings
+cargo fmt --all -- --check
+
+# Run CLI
+cargo run -- <command>
+
+# Justfile targets (local CI, deny, grade)
+just ci
+just deny
+just grade
+```
+
+## Layout
+
+```
+helioscope/
+├── crates/                # Rust harness crates (harness_*)
+├── codex-rs/              # Rust workspace (agent runtime, protocol, TUI, sandbox)
+├── codex-cli/             # TypeScript CLI workspace
+├── api/                   # API definitions
+├── docs/                  # Documentation, ADRs, sessions
+├── .github/               # CI workflows, issue templates, CODEOWNERS
+├── governance/            # This directory (base templates)
+├── Cargo.toml             # Root workspace manifest (harness crates)
+├── deny.toml              # cargo-deny configuration
+├── justfile               # Just command runner
+├── lefthook.yml           # Git hooks
+├── AGENTS.md              # Agent instructions (this file at root)
+└── CLAUDE.md              # Project context for agents
+```
+
+## Fleet Conventions
+
+- **Commits:** Conventional Commits (`feat|fix|chore|docs|refactor|perf|test|ci|revert`)
+- **Branches:** `wip/*` → `main` (via PR); worktree isolation for active development
+- **Review:** PRs require 1 reviewer; review-wave-orchestrator manages load
+- **Dependencies:** `deny.toml` governs license/advisory policy; `cargo deny` in CI
+- **Security:** CodeQL, Snyk, Trivy, TruffleHog in CI pipeline; weekly cargo-audit
+
+## CI Contract
+
+The `.github/workflows/ci.yml` runs: lint → test → audit → deny → grade.
+Additional gates: governance-audit (weekly), scorecard (weekly), stage-gates (per-PR).
+
+## Local Overrides
+
+Per-repo customization goes in:
+- `CLAUDE.md` — Project context for AI agents (this repo's copy of CLAUDE.base.md)
+- `AGENTS.md` — This file at root (agent instructions)
+- `deny.toml` — Dependency exceptions
+- `.github/codespell-ignore.txt` — Spellcheck exceptions
+
+## Troubleshooting
+
+See `CLAUDE.md` Troubleshooting section or `docs/sessions/` for session-based work documentation.
