+# CLAUDE.md — Base Template for helioscope
+
+<!--
+  Copy this to repo root as CLAUDE.md and customize per-repo sections
+  marked with ⚙️. This file lives in governance/ as the canonical base.
+-->
+
+## Project Overview
+
+**helioscope** — Umbrella monorepo for the Helioscope platform: a community fork of OpenAI Codex CLI with multi-crate Rust harness system, TypeScript agent UI, and Phenotype governance.
+
+## Stack
+
+- **Language:** Rust (edition 2021) + TypeScript
+- **Build:** `cargo` (root + codex-rs workspaces), `bazel` (full monorepo), `pnpm` (codex-cli)
+- **Platform:** macOS, Linux, Windows (cross-platform via Bazel)
+- **Runtime:** tokio (async Rust), Node.js (codex-cli)
+
+## Key Commands
+
+```bash
+# Build harness crates
+cargo build
+
+# Build everything
+cargo build --workspace
+bazel build //...
+
+# Test
+cargo test --workspace
+
+# Lint
+cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings
+cargo fmt --all -- --check
+
+# Local CI
+just ci
+
+# Dependency audit
+cargo deny check
+cargo audit
+
+# Grade
+just grade
+```
+
+## Architecture
+
+```
+helioscope/
+├── crates/                  # Root workspace: harness_* crates (queue, rollback, runner, scaling, schema, spec, teammates, utils, verify)
+├── codex-rs/                # Sub-workspace: agent runtime, protocol, TUI, sandbox, exec, config
+│   ├── app-server/          # Server process & message handling
+│   ├── cli/                 # CLI entrypoint
+│   ├── core/                # Core agent logic
+│   ├── tui/                 # Terminal UI
+│   ├── exec/                # Non-interactive execution
+│   ├── sandbox/             # Container sandbox infrastructure
+│   └── utils/               # Shared utilities (stream-parser, string, sleep-inhibitor, etc.)
+├── codex-cli/               # TypeScript CLI workspace
+│   ├── cli/                 # Node.js CLI entrypoint
+│   ├── core/                # TS agent core
+│   └── protocol/            # Wire protocol types
+├── api/                     # API specs (OpenAPI/AsyncAPI)
+├── docs/                    # ADRs, sessions, architecture
+├── .github/workflows/       # CI pipeline (62 workflows)
+└── governance/              # This directory (base templates)
+```
+
+## Testing Strategy
+
+- **Unit:** `cargo test --lib` (Rust), `jest` (TypeScript)
+- **Integration:** `cargo test --test integration` (Rust)
+- **E2E:** `cargo test --test e2e` (Rust), Playwright (TS)
+- **Property-based:** proptest in `crates/arch_test`
+- **Benchmarks:** `cargo bench` (harness_cache, etc.)
+
+## Deployment
+
+- **Binary release:** `helios-cli` published via `.github/workflows/helios-cli-release.yml`
+- **Sandbox:** Docker-based container image for code execution isolation
+- **CI/CD:** GitHub Actions with 62 workflow files covering CI, release, security, quality, and governance
+
+## Fleet Integration
+
+This repo consumes from `phenotype/phenotype-ops`:
+- **CI templates:** Shared workflow references where applicable
+- **Review:** Unified code review via org webhook (review-wave-orchestrator)
+- **Attestation:** Manifest-gate in CI pipeline
+
+## Local Development
+
+```bash
+# Install tools
+cargo install just cargo-deny cargo-audit lefthook --locked
+
+# Install git hooks
+lefthook install
+
+# Full local CI
+just ci
+
+# Quick build-check
+cargo check --workspace
+```
+
+## Code Review
+
+PRs route through the unified review surface. One backend tool selected per PR (Forge primary). Results posted as GitHub Check Run.
+
+## Troubleshooting
+
+| Issue | Fix |
+|-------|-----|
+| `cargo build` fails in root but not in codex-rs | Check `Cargo.toml` workspace members — root only includes `crates/harness_*` |
+| Bazel build missing rules | Run `bazel sync` then `bazel build //...` |
+| Lefthook not running | `lefthook install` then retry commit/push |
+| CI fails on manifest | Run `just grade` locally or regenerate manifest |
+
+## Related Files
+
+- `AGENTS.md` — Agent instructions (this repo's copy of AGENTS.base.md)
+- `lefthook.yml` — Pre-push/commit hooks
+- `deny.toml` — Dependency policy (cargo-deny)
+- `justfile` — Just command recipes
+- `.github/workflows/` — CI pipeline definitions
