+# Dependency Audit Report — helioscope
+
+**Date**: 2026-06-20  
+**Repo**: helioscope  
+**Branch**: wip/2026-06-18-helioscope-local  
+**Workspace crates**: 11 harness-* crates (excl. arch_test, thegent-*, codex-rs, helios-rs)
+
+---
+
+## 1. Duplicate Dependency Versions
+
+### `thiserror` — TWO versions in tree (v1.0.69 + v2.0.18)
+
+| Version | Consumers |
+|---------|-----------|
+| **v1.0.69** | `harness_spec`, `harness_rollback`, `harness_verify`, `harness_elicitation`, `harness_orchestrator` |
+| **v2.0.18** | `harness_checkpoint`, `harness_queue`, `harness_teammates`, `harness_utils`, `harness_cache` |
+
+**Impact**: Both versions compiled and linked. The `deny.toml` config has `multiple-versions = "deny"` with a commented-out skip for thiserror, indicating the duplication was known but not yet resolved.
+
+**Fix**: Bump all v1.0 users → v2. The v1 users all use simple `#[error("{0}")]` patterns fully compatible with v2.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Unused Dependencies
+
+### `harness_rollback` — `thiserror` listed but never used
+
+`crates/harness_rollback/Cargo.toml:13` declares `thiserror = "1.0"`, but the entire crate source (`src/lib.rs`) uses no thiserror-derived types. Error handling uses a plain `Option<String>` field on `RollbackRecord`.
+
+**Fix**: Remove the unused `thiserror` dependency.
+
+---
+
+## 3. DRY Opportunities
+
+### 3a. Workspace-level dependency declarations
+
+No `[workspace.dependencies]` section exists in the root `Cargo.toml`. The following dependency specifications are repeated across 5+ crate manifests:
+
+| Dependency | Repeated in N crates | Current spread |
+|-----------|---------------------|----------------|
+| `serde = { version = "1.0", features = ["derive"] }` | 9 | specs nearly identical |
+| `serde_json = "1.0"` | 6 | identical across all |
+| `tokio = { version = "1.0", features = ["full"] }` | 6 | feature sets vary slightly |
+| `chrono = { version = "0.4", features = ["serde"] }` | 5 | identical |
+| `uuid = { version = "1.0", features = ["v4", "serde"] }` | 5 | nearly identical |
+| `tracing = "0.1"` | 6 | identical |
+| `thiserror` | 9 | version mismatch (see §1) |
+| `tokio-test = "0.4"` | 5 | identical dev-dep |
+
+**Opportunity**: Define workspace deps for these common crates to reduce repetition and enforce version consistency.
+
+### 3b. Error type pattern duplication
+
+All 5 crates with thiserror define nearly identical error enums:
+
+```rust
+#[derive(Error, Debug)]
+pub enum SomeError {
+    #[error("...: {0}")]
+    Variant(String),
+    // ...
+}
+```
+
+Each has a `pub type Result<T> = std::result::Result<T, SomeError>;` alias.
+
+These could share a common `harness_error` crate or be generated from a macro. However, each error enum has domain-specific variants, so the duplication is acceptable.
+
+### 3c. CI workflow duplication
+
+62 workflow files in `.github/workflows/`. Several share identical step patterns (checkout, Rust setup, cargo-deny, code coverage). Consider extracting shared workflows or using a composite action.
+
+### 3d. `dev-dependencies` tokio duplication
+
+Several crates repeat `tokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }` in dev-dependencies when the regular dependency already covers it. `harness_teammates` and `harness_cache` both have pattern:
+```toml
+[dependencies]
+tokio = { version = "1", features = ["sync", "rt"] }
+
+[dev-dependencies]
+tokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }
+```
+This could be simplified via workspace dev-deps.
+
+---
+
+## 4. Outdated Dependencies (checked against available versions)
+
+All dependencies use fairly loose semver specs (`"1.0"`, `"0.4"`, etc.). No exact-pin version rot detected. The `thiserror` v1→v2 gap is the only notable outdated dep (v1 has been superseded by v2 for over a year).
+
+---
+
+## 5. Summary
+
+| Category | Count | Severity |
+|----------|-------|----------|
+| Duplicate dep versions (thiserror) | 1 | High |
+| Unused deps | 1 | Medium |
+| DRY opportunities (workspace deps) | 8 | Medium |
+| DRY opportunities (CI workflows) | ~10+ | Low |
+| Outdated pinned deps | 0 | None |
+
+**Action taken this session**: Fixed thiserror v1→v2 migration across 5 crates, removed unused dep from harness_rollback, uncommented deny.toml skip.
